        "original_id": "b0f36da3-9a1a-56aa-a2ca-7a4cd304952e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Cab, Never Shout Never, Hey Monday\n- Publications: Alternative Press\n- Places: Joplin, Missouri\n- Topics: discographies, music releases, magazine recognition\n\nFacts:\n- In 2007, Never Shout Never was formed in Joplin, Missouri.\n- In 2008, Alternative Press called The Cab \"The Band You Need to Know 2008.\"\n- In 2010, Alternative Press featured The Cab in its \"100 Bands You Need to Know in 2010\" list and placed the band on the cover with Never Shout Never and Hey Monday.\n- The Cab is an American rock band.\n- The Cab has released two studio albums, four extended plays, nine singles, and eight music videos.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "93aac75a-e637-51a4-8797-66318f4a781a",
        "text": "Page: The Cab discography. Sentence: American rock band The Cab has released two studio albums, four extended plays, nine singles and eight music videos.\nPage: The Cab discography. Sentence: They have been called \"The Band You Need to Know 2008\" by \"Alternative Press\" magazine.\nPage: The Cab discography. Sentence: They were also featured in the '100 Bands You Need to Know in 2010' by the magazine and were one of the three bands featured on the cover page, along with Never Shout Never and Hey Monday.\nPage: Never Shout Never. Sentence: Never Shout Never is an American rock band formed in Joplin, Missouri in 2007.",
